---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_init: caller authorized
    q_check_init --> q_revert_init: results not initialized
    q_revert_init --> [*]: revert ResultsNotInitialized
    q_check_init --> q_check_published: results initialized
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: results already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set_data: results not yet published
    q_set_data --> q_set_totals: set claimMerkleRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> [*]: set totalTokensAllocated, totalCapitalRaised, resultsPublished = true, emit SaleResultsPublished

    note right of q_check_init
        INV-001: publish requires prior initialization (two-step process)
        INV-002: Merkle roots immutable once set
    end note
